# The PC-6001mkII's part (zcc +pc6001 -subtype=mk2disc): linked before pc6001_clib (lib/config/pc6001.cfg, -clib=mk2disc), so what it has replaces the PC-6001's:
# the disc, overlays and interrupts, the 320x200 mode of the console and graphics (the mc6847 library has stubs for it) and the wide (16 bit) graphics on top of it
target/pc6001/obj/pc6001/x/target/pc6001/mk2/*.o
# (the 320x200 pixels are nearly square: the circle of square pixels, as the fp1100's, not the default's ellipse)
classic/gfx/wide/obj/${TARGET}/w_dcircle_square
@classic/gfx/wide/gfx_wide.lst
